OL,5,G1800 The Secret World of Posh Pets
OL,6,     FMillionaires Debi and Bob are
OL,7,     Fplanning an expensive wedding for
OL,8,     Ftheir Chihuahuas. Plus, we meet
OL,9,     Fdog portrait artist Robert Clarke,
OL,10,     Fwhose clients are charged a hefty
OL,11,     Ffee for his services.
OL,12,G1830 The Secret World of Posh Pets
OL,13,     FIn Doncaster, Bryn breeds over 2
OL,14,     Fmillion pounds worth of falcons to
OL,15,     Fsell to the super-rich in the
OL,16,     FMiddle East. Meanwhile, Debbie's
OL,17,     FChihuahuas Honey and Joey are
OL,18,     Ffinally tying the knot.
