OL,5,G2100 Inside the Operating Theatre
OL,6,     FDr Fox is in the visitors' room
OL,7,     Ffor a change when his fiancee
OL,8,     FSally has an operation to remove
OL,9,     Fher wisdom teeth. Another patient
OL,10,     Fhas surgery to have a double
OL,11,     Fhernia repaired.
OL,12,G2200 Inside the Operating Theatre
OL,13,     FOne patient is flown home from
OL,14,     Fholiday for an urgent operation to
OL,15,     Frepair a detached retina, while
OL,16,     Fanother has a leaky vein that has
OL,17,     Fcaused an ulcer in his leg.
